        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "The Vaudreuil-Dorion Youth Center welcomes young people aged 12 to 17 and their goal is to be a place for learning citizenship, an educational tool for young people, an extension of the street corner & a living environment to express themselves and be creative. Our activities are free for young people. Our facilitators are looking forward to seeing you!",
